1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Install in about two minutes.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:07,600
Download the zip from the website.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:11,800
Unzip it: right-click, Extract All.
On a Mac, double-click it.

4
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:16,000
Move the folder somewhere it can stay.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Open chrome://extensions.

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Switch on Developer mode.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Click Load unpacked.

8
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,800
Pick the unzipped folder, then Select.

9
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:29,000
Installed. The settings page
opens by itself.

10
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Tick the AIs you use.

11
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,400
Pin it from the puzzle-piece menu.

12
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:39,700
In Gmail, right-click an email.
Pick an AI.

13
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:42,667
It copies the thread and opens your AI.

14
00:00:43,167 --> 00:00:48,900
Paste it, check it, then press Enter.

15
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:51,200
Free and open source.

16
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:54,000
Coming soon to the Chrome Web Store.
